   }
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 261,
   "text": "You and your partner or housemates may decide to open a joint account for your shared bills. Discuss what bills you will pay with your shared account and how much you will each contribute.\nLearn more about relationships and money and managing money as a couple.",
