  {
   "index": 14,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 247,
   "text": "When you have a joint account, you share liability for any debts connected to that account.\nIf another account holder runs up debt on that account, it could harm your credit report.\nLearn how to do a budget and how to track your spending together.",
