   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 711,
   "text": "Costa works interstate a lot. He decided to open a joint account with his partner, Jo. The joint account meant he wouldn't have to worry about paying his bills when he was away. Jo would arrange it for him.\nA few weeks later, Costa checked his account to make sure his boss had paid him that week. He was shocked to find there was no money in the account. Costa tried to contact Jo but his calls were",
